<urn:atm:triage:finding/R5-QA3-ARCH-012>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "R5-QA3-ARCH-012" ;
  triage:title "The binding code sample for CheckResponse::into_answers (in the 'Explicit code samples' block) places response-to-answer mapping in sc_decision_schema::jev" ;
  triage:description "The binding code sample for CheckResponse::into_answers (in the 'Explicit code samples' block) places response-to-answer mapping in sc_decision_schema::jev::v1. That contradicts ADR-SAG-0012 r-5 (see ARCH-011). RULE-ADR-PLAN treats a plan that contradicts a binding ADR as Blocking even when intended." ;
